---
/**
 * The three interface artifacts from design 2a's hero: a Google listing, a
 * search result, and an AI answer — rendered as real components, not images.
 * Sample content is fictional and labeled ILLUSTRATIVE, exactly as designed.
 */
---

<div class="flex flex-col gap-4" aria-label="Examples of the three surfaces patients meet: Google listing, search result, AI answer">
  <figure class="m-0 rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-surface p-5.5 shadow-card">
    <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-faint">Chart 01 · Google listing</span>
      <span class="rounded-full bg-pass-tint px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-pass">Maintained</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_96px] items-start gap-4">
      <div>
        <p class="text-lg font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink">Shreeji Dental &amp; Implant Centre</p>
        <p class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-faint">
          <span class="text-[13px] font-bold text-ink">4.8</span>
          <span class="tracking-[1px] text-star" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span>
          <span>(214) · Dentist</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted">
          Radhanpur Road, Mehsana · 1.2 km<br />
          <span class="font-semibold text-pass">Open</span> · closes 8:30 pm
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3.5 flex gap-1.5">
          <span class="rounded-full border border-line-hover px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[11.5px] font-semibold text-surgical">Directions</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-line-hover px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[11.5px] font-semibold text-surgical">Call</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-line-hover px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[11.5px] font-semibold text-surgical">WhatsApp</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-rows-[44px_44px] gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="rounded-lg bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#E9ECEF_0_7px,#F3F5F7_7px_14px)]"></div>
        <div class="rounded-lg bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#E9ECEF_0_7px,#F3F5F7_7px_14px)]"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </figure>

  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <figure class="m-0 rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-surface p-5.5 shadow-card">
      <p class="mb-3.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-faint">Chart 02 · Search</p>
      <p class="text-[11.5px] text-muted">shreejidental.in › implants</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] font-semibold leading-[1.35] text-surgical">
        Dental Implants in Mehsana — Cost, Steps &amp; Recovery
      </p>
      <p class="mt-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.55] text-muted">
        Single implant from ₹18,000. Two visits, 30 minutes each. What it feels
        like, who it suits…
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
        <span class="rounded-md bg-hairline-soft px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-muted">FAQ schema</span>
        <span class="rounded-md bg-hairline-soft px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-muted">Price shown</span>
      </p>
    </figure>

    <figure class="m-0 rounded-[20px] bg-panel p-5.5 shadow-card">
      <p class="mb-3.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-panel-text-faint">Chart 03 · AI answer</p>
      <p class="text-[12.5px] text-panel-text-dim">"Best clinic for dental implants in Mehsana?"</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-hairline">
        Three clinics list implantology with published pricing.
        <span class="font-semibold text-panel-accent">Shreeji Dental &amp; Implant Centre</span>
        documents its implant protocol, costs and recovery times…
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3.5 flex gap-1.5">
        <span class="rounded-md border border-panel-line-alt px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-panel-text-dim">Cited 1/3</span>
        <span class="rounded-md border border-panel-line-alt px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-panel-text-dim">Entity matched</span>
      </p>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase leading-[1.6] tracking-[0.06em] text-faint">
    Illustrative — replaced with the first founding practice's real screens at launch.
  </p>
</div>
